{"id":"n14616-1-7","stage":3,"title":"마련 · 难免","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14616-1-7-1","ko":"급한 일을 하다가 또 실수를 했어.","zh":"我正在处理急事，结果又出错了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"급한","meaning":"急忙，急切，急促","explanation":"급하다：急忙，急切，急促；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"급하다","audio":"/audio/5c52cd24e00b6dba18be.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86862","senseId":"2","lemma":"급하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"급한","audio":"/audio/7a0bb6f355fdc74035ac.mp3"}},{"text":"일을","meaning":"事，工作","explanation":"일：事，工作；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"5","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일을","audio":"/audio/9a5fd6c2b18669a93295.mp3"}},{"text":"하다가","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；다가：表示原有动作或状态中途转为另一情况。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하다가","audio":"/audio/4b34e3a9f6a4443fcde6.mp3"}},{"text":"또","meaning":"又","explanation":"또：又。","readings":[{"term":"또","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"51887","senseId":"1","lemma":"또","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"또","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3"}},{"text":"실수를","meaning":"失手，失误","explanation":"실수：失手，失误；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"실수","audio":"/audio/546e211475887e7443f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64947","senseId":"1","lemma":"실수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"실수를","audio":"/audio/19e1517b3067726f9af8.mp3"}},{"text":"했어.","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했어","audio":"/audio/76f3569b074c48dd5200.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"5c52cd24e00b6dba","term":"급하다","zh":"急忙，急切，急促","audio":"/audio/5c52cd24e00b6dba18be.mp3","entryId":"86862","definition":"做事匆促，没有闲暇。","pronunciation":["그파다"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事，工作","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"需要解决或处理的问题或事项。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"c7c5916d2df73410","term":"또","zh":"又","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3","entryId":"51887","definition":"某件事情或行为再次发生。","pronunciation":["또"]},{"id":"546e211475887e74","term":"실수","zh":"失手，失误","audio":"/audio/546e211475887e7443f1.mp3","entryId":"64947","definition":"因不了解或不小心而犯的错误。","pronunciation":["실쑤"]}],"audio":"/audio/1435bd38a1cea15a3803.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14616-1-7-2","ko":"서두르면 누구나 실수하기 마련이야.","zh":"着急的时候，谁都难免会犯错。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"서두르면","meaning":"着急，操之过急","explanation":"서두르다：着急，操之过急；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"서두르다","audio":"/audio/46ed6fddc77dbc72dcc7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62311","senseId":"1","lemma":"서두르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"서두르면","audio":"/audio/80e2d25b3d6f650ad064.mp3"}},{"text":"누구나","meaning":"谁都，无论是谁","explanation":"누구：谁都，无论是谁；나：表示不止预期的数量、举例或退而求其次等，需结合整句语气。","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"2","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"누구나","audio":"/audio/578816a004f3d0c389b7.mp3"}},{"text":"실수하기","meaning":"失手，失误","explanation":"실수하다：失手，失误；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。","readings":[{"term":"실수하다","audio":"/audio/489b22a0d033512abf60.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14092","senseId":"1","lemma":"실수하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"실수하기","audio":"/audio/92f7710ade194ad975b4.mp3"}},{"text":"마련이야.","meaning":"难免，必然","explanation":"마련：难免，必然；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"마련","audio":"/audio/e0cb6646df7a19346e75.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14616","senseId":"1","lemma":"마련","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마련이야","audio":"/audio/ee5b61c71b6944dcbfb6.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"46ed6fddc77dbc72","term":"서두르다","zh":"着急，操之过急","audio":"/audio/46ed6fddc77dbc72dcc7.mp3","entryId":"62311","definition":"为了快点做某事而不沉着、忙于行动。","pronunciation":["서두르다"]},{"id":"e9e6266b8035d7c4","term":"누구","zh":"谁都，无论是谁","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3","entryId":"62078","definition":"指尚未确定的人。","pronunciation":["누구"]},{"id":"489b22a0d033512a","term":"실수하다","zh":"失手，失误","audio":"/audio/489b22a0d033512abf60.mp3","entryId":"14092","definition":"因不清楚或不小心而犯下错误。","pronunciation":["실쑤하다"]},{"id":"e0cb6646df7a1934","term":"마련","zh":"难免，必然","audio":"/audio/e0cb6646df7a19346e75.mp3","entryId":"14616","definition":"表示理所当然。","pronunciation":["마련"]}],"audio":"/audio/78e0025836e09324eecc.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.231,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14616","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":119,"sequenceScore":3.6063,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我正在处理急事，结果又出错了。","着急的时候，谁都难免会犯错。","你看过那部电影吗？大家都说很不错呢。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我正在处理急事，结果又出错了。","着急的时候，谁都难免会犯错。","你看过那部电影吗？大家都说很不错呢。"],"answer":1}]}
